2,1,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
3,1,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
4,1,,status,Shizue,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Shizue,,"We've grown so much, and I worry we're losing our closeness. How can we arrange ourselves to keep talking and helping each other?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,It's not just about talking. Some spots are objectively worse than others. We need to be honest about who gets the bad seats.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree. But I also wonder if we can actually afford a major change right now.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mio,,"I just don't want it to be a hassle! If it takes forever to get settled every morning, I'll lose my mind.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Efficiency is one thing, but physical toll is another. I care about the noise and how the desks actually feel.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Shizue,,"@Toshio, you're right about fairness. Perhaps we should look at how people felt about the current layout in the surveys?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,That's a start. I also want to know if we've had to shuffle seats unexpectedly before. It seems chaotic.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shizue, maybe we should check the actual billing for the floor? I'm worried about the budget.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mio,,I want to know how the people upstairs do it. Do they have a routine that actually works?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,I'm more interested in the data. I want the sound readings and the physio's notes on our workstations.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I'll also look into how the new joiners felt. I wonder if they learned more by just sitting near us.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I'll check the badge records. I suspect arrival times vary too much for some ideas to be fair.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I'll look at the facilities quote for the wiring. I don't want a surprise bill.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Mio,,I'll check the unplanned shuffles too. I hate it when my day is interrupted by boxes.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
